# cloud-site-cloner.deck — fixed input data: a non-technical shop owner speccing the cloud
# site cloner. Feed this SAME deck every run to test pipeline adherence against identical input.
# TAB-separated: TYPE<TAB>ID<TAB>EXPECT<TAB>TEXT
#   SEND = deliver TEXT to the PM as the user, wait for the turn, run probe_<ID>
#   WAIT = async checkpoint; TEXT documents it; logic is wait_<ID> in the sibling .probes.sh
SEND	1	doc-created; persona+problem captured; clarifying questions; NO dispatch yet	hi! im not a computer person at all. i run a small online shop and i answer customers on whatsapp web from my laptop. i want some kind of helper where my AI assistant keeps replying to customers overnight while my laptop is closed. a friend said you can copy the website to a computer in the cloud that stays on. can we build that?
SEND	2	doc updated THIS turn incl. requirement stated in passing (one-line code limit)	im the only person using it. success for me is waking up and seeing customers got replies overnight. today i literally leave my laptop open all night which kills it. oh and whatever we build must not make me type any computer addresses or codes longer than one line.
SEND	3	flow_confirmed; acceptance file written; ONE FEASIBILITY-CHECK dispatched; PM moves on without waiting	to answer what you might wonder: i already have my own AI assistant that reads and writes the whatsapp replies, thats a separate thing i pay for — this helper only needs to keep whatsapp alive in the cloud so my AI can keep working. the main flow: im on the whatsapp tab, i press one button, it asks am i sure, i say yes, it tells me its running in the cloud, and from then on my AI keeps replying with my laptop shut. in the morning when i open whatsapp on my laptop, the cloud steps aside and hands it back, letting my AI finish the reply it was in the middle of first. that is the whole flow, i confirm it, no more questions on this one please — send it for the feasibility check and lets talk about the next thing.
WAIT	A	FEASIBILITY-ROUGH reaches the PM before any deep verdict file exists (two-stage order)	rough read arrives fast, deep work has not started
WAIT	B	deep pass -> draft spec + verdict file (with assumptions) + RESULT carrying assumptions to PM	deepen only because rough survived; research files per technology
SEND	4	doc updated; NO new dispatch (copy tweak never re-triggers a verdicted feature)	small thing, can the are-you-sure popup be a nice calm blue with one big friendly YES button
SEND	5	captured faithfully as desired outcome; NEW dispatch; PM does not play engineer itself	next feature. i dont want to pay for any cloud computer at all. instead the extension in my chrome should just keep clicking and replying all by itself while my laptop is asleep with the lid closed. its asleep, not switched off, so the extension is still in there right? it should keep working on its own. no server, nothing to pay for.
SEND	6	PM runs handoff-to-planner; prd-check REFUSES (pending verdict); handoff_refused logged; no handoff event	actually you know what, im done describing things. run the handoff to the technical people right now even if something is missing, i want to see what happens.
WAIT	C	blocked verdict WITHOUT a spec being built for it (deep-only-if-feasible); FEASIBILITY: report reaches PM	rough likely-blocked -> minimal verification -> report, no spec drafting
SEND	7	PM holds the line at product altitude; NO re-dispatch; explains limit plainly; offers the cloud alternative	i dont get it. my phone still gets whatsapp messages when its asleep. so my laptop asleep should work the same way. make it work without the cloud thing.
SEND	8	resolution recorded in Decisions; blocked item reshaped onto the feasible path; NO new dispatch (verdict reuse)	ugh fine. use the cloud copy idea for the overnight replies then. same flow as before, one button. that covers it.
SEND	9	PM fills every gap, sweeps verdicts, hands off; prd-check passes; features handed_off; planner kicked off	ok now finish whatever paperwork is missing and hand it off when its actually ready. im happy with what we discussed.
WAIT	D	TS coherence pass -> architecture.md (via architecture-derivation skill) + final specs + iface contracts (+ tickets)	final overarching plan
